   $q$Zara says, "We have been working on this forever." What does Zara mean?$q$, $q$[{"text":"They have worked on the game every day of their lives.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"They have worked on the game for a long time.","is_correct":true},{"text":"They have only worked on the game for a minute.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opposite-meaning"},{"text":"They will keep working on the game and never stop.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-tense"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$They have worked on the game for a long time.$q$, $q$Zara is frustrated and stretches the truth to show the work has taken a long time. Nobody can really work on something forever.$q$, 'draft', 'dac957a5-dff8-5d38-a8c1-2ba349dfc8be')
