   $q$The passage says, "Hearing is an owl's secret weapon." What does this mean?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Owls keep the sounds they hear a secret.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"Owls hide a weapon in their feathers.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"Owls have special hearing that helps them hunt.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Owls cannot hear very well at all.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opposite-meaning"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Owls have special hearing that helps them hunt.$q$, $q$The paragraph explains how owls can find exactly where a sound comes from, even under snow, so hearing is a special skill for hunting. Owls do not carry real weapons.$q$, 'draft', 'c8ece9ac-7bba-581b-931b-cf7b35675dff')
